      "searchCoverage": "Official ArcGIS Geocoding REST API (token query + f=json at geocode-api.arcgis.com), suggest/findAddressCandidates/reverseGeocode, pricing (Suggests are 0 credits; stored/not-stored geocodes are billed), HTTP 200 error envelopes (code 498/499), Esri identity (Redlands, CA), April 2026 ArcGIS Security Bulletin developer-credential CVEs patched 2026-04-13 (historical, remediated; not this geocode SKU customer-account compromise), CVE-2026-13019 Portal for ArcGIS self-hosted (out of scope), and dated incident search (ArcGIS Online geocode + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. No current unresolved ArcGIS Online geocode-service compromise identified. This is not a breach-free claim.",
